{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZBbsKocZOx1794196010.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波指，人工智能價值鏈企業為市場增添深度，不過會計界面對AI時也要提升技能。</p><p></p><p>財政司司長陳茂波表示︰「人工智能可高效地完成日常工作，但輸出的局限性和假設的有效性，需要透過專業判斷作仔細審查人工智能偽造文件的風險，令質疑證據的可靠性變得更重要。業界必須尋找新的方式來履行職責，培訓和提升管理人員和員工的能力。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.542213+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:56:08.446641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:44.275329+00:00","content_hash":"fc2a756b63bc37c52ab9b5b386599dfa6248012ea28072a12da8ee253f460d04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.542213+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}